{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/794646-tumblr-otherkin-and-beasts","id":794646,"title":"Tumblr Otherkin and Beasts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-28T23:41:37-08:00","id":794646,"title":"Tumblr Otherkin and Beasts","content":"For those of you who don't know what a Otherkin is, it's basically someone who identifies with as partially or completely non-human on a spiritual level, claiming they are reincarnated souls of mythical creatures of some kind. One could think he's a dragon, or an angel, or a griffon or whatever you wish.<br /> <br /> What if some of those &quot;Otherkin&quot; in Chronicles of Darkness are actually Beasts? :O","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T00:07:30-08:00","id":794653,"title":"","content":"I question the worth of including mention of a particular website in this thread's title, given the cultural phenomenon in question pre-dates its existence by a fairly lengthy span of time.<br /> <br /> <br /> The mythological monsters are the actors assigned to humanity's fears of Bad Things happening to them. If the dragon doesn't have a mighty need to rule, ruin, pilfer, punish, or prey upon others then it's too much of a romanticized ideal to be one of the Begotten.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon